aragraph\" >A truly unique score-keeping method</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A final 'brag screen' that you can use to challenge your friends to run your same maze and attempt to beat your score.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Maze is the first published game by Rum Shack Studios, a small (4 person) team of game players, designers and dreamers who have big plans for the future. We hope you enjoy it and look forward to hearing your comments!</p>","developers":["Rum Shack Studios LLC"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3854270/8dd2327092961af4a5989989d2e2bbf134fbc193/header.jpg?t=1755866010","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257180439,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257180439/movie480.mp4?t=1754666842","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257180439/movie_max.mp4?t=1754666842"},"name":"Midnight Murder Maze Early Access Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257180439/922db103dc22d9a8c2b44034b426cc131b82a02d/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1754666842","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257180439/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1754666842","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257180439/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1754666842"}},{"highlight":true,"id":257175768,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257175768/movie480.mp4?t=1754578132","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257175768/movie_max.mp4?t=1754578132"},"name":"Midnight Murder Maze Early Access Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257175768/1a62fe8ac6f1a92a8845bbcad479114d3b86e43f/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1754578132","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.stea